   (Canonsburg, Pennsylvania: Carl Quintanilla) Senator John Kerry\u2019s efforts to regain momentum after falling behind President Bush in the polls featured; scenes shown of anti-Kerry demonstrators in Pennsylvania; details given of his hiring of new campaign staff and his focus on the economy. [In West Virginia, KERRY \u2013 says the \u201cW\u201d {in George W. Bush} stands for \u201cwrong.\u201d] [Bush supporter Robert FULK&#135;, Kerry supporter Betty LUBA&#135;- voice opinions.]   (Studio: Brian Williams) Report introduced.   (Poplar Bluff, Missouri: David Gregory) Bush\u2019s response to Kerry\u2019s attacks, including his decision to go to war in Iraq, featured. [BUSH \u2013 criticizes Kerry.]", "segment_duration": 220, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "64170.0", "legacy_segment_id": 764506, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "t77V6TS8HH", "broadcast_date": "2004-09-06", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1700, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 764495, "segment_id": "uMNN9t6eUk", "segment_broadcast_id": "t77V6TS8HH", "segment_title": "Upcoming Items (Studio: Brian Williams)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 10, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "64390.0", "legacy_segment_id": 764507, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "t77V6TS8HH", "broadcast_date": "2004-09-06", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_i